    <briefdescription>
<para>Models the concept of a perfect hash function. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>phf&lt;H&gt; models a perfect hash function of type Hashable(H) -&gt; size_t where H is a hash function of type Hashable(H) -&gt; size_t using only one level of hashing.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>H</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>hash function type </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
